{"id":"fizicheski","lemma":"физически","pos":"adv","rank":2411,"glosses":["physically"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1b/Ru-%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Думаю, это физически невозможно.","en":"I think that's physically impossible.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"it is impossible"}]},{"text":"Мужчины физически сильнее женщин.","en":"Men are physically stronger than women.","words":[{"g":"man","l":"мужчина"},null,{"g":"strong, powerful","l":"сильный"},null]},{"text":"Я умственно и физически устала.","en":"I was mentally and physically tired.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"mentally"},{"g":"and"},null,null]},{"text":"Я снова физически здоров.","en":"I'm physically healthy again.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"anew"},null,null]},{"text":"Женщины физически слабее мужчин.","en":"Women are physically weaker than men.","words":[{"g":"woman","l":"женщина"},null,{"g":"weak, feeble","l":"слабый"},null]}]}